 4. 💰 Charted: Wall Street&#x27;s record profits 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: NYSE/Intercontinental Exchange via the New York State Comptroller. (2026 projected by the comptroller as if first-half growth continues.) Chart: Emily Peck/Axios Wall Street profits are blowing past expectations this year and are on track for an all-time record, Axios' Emily Peck writes from a new report by the New York State Comptroller's office. 

 In the first half of this year, Wall Street firms raked in $45.9 billion — 51.3% more than the same period last year. Keep reading ... Get Axios Markets . 

 
 
